WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
Your Majesty, the important task of lighting the fire is left to you.

2
00:00:04,260 --> 00:00:05,260
Me?

3
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:11,140
Just remember to click the fuse and run away. Don't blow up your hands.

4
00:00:11,140 --> 00:00:14,930
Disgrace yourself

5
00:00:14,930 --> 00:00:23,560
No!

6
00:00:23,560 --> 00:00:27,060
Family members in front of the screen, do you think the main bag can still escape the picture circle?

7
00:00:41,640 --> 00:00:43,640
Zhang Wansen, is it snowing?

8
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:46,140
Oh no, it's raining

9
00:00:46,640 --> 00:00:51,140
When I am reborn, I fry cow dung in the school starting point. How should the principal respond?

10
00:00:52,890 --> 00:00:56,890
The reborn me exploded cow dung at the company's annual meeting. How should the leader respond?

11
00:00:57,390 --> 00:01:03,110
As soon as cow dung was fried, the whole world went crazy

12
00:01:03,110 --> 00:01:06,110
I've forgotten my love, and I'm going to die so hard

13
00:01:06,110 --> 00:01:11,140
Taxi knows nothing, Vatamizi knows

14
00:01:11,140 --> 00:01:14,640
Brother, the boys are going to be rescued from the tree and beaten.

15
00:01:14,640 --> 00:01:20,300
We are brats, so what are you?

16
00:01:20,300 --> 00:01:23,300
What about saving wild animals and saving milk?
